# CatDex — React Native

## Defaults

- Functional components + hooks only
- Style with theme tokens; avoid large inline magic numbers
- Prefer `StyleSheet.create` for static styles; dynamic values from `useTheme()`
- Platform splits: `.native.tsx` / `.web.tsx` when behavior truly differs (see `CatMap`)

## Structure

- Screens in `app/` stay thin — compose feature components from `src/components/`
- Shared UI under `src/components/`; feature folders (`maps/`, `Auth/`, `reward/`, …)
- Hooks in `src/hooks/`; pure logic in `src/lib/`

## Lists & images

- Use FlashList/FlatList patterns already in album screens; stable `key`s
- Cat photos: `CatImage` / storage helpers — handle `blob:`, failed loads, and persistent URIs (`photoUri` utils)

## Gestures & press

- Prefer `PressableScale` or theme `motion.pressScale` for primary controls
- Capture FAB: map HUD (`MapExplorerHud`) — keep hit target ≥ 48

## Do not

- Import DOM-only APIs in shared files without Platform guards
- Mutate props/state objects in place (prefer immutable updates)
- Add navigation containers inside screens (expo-router owns navigation)
